# VersicherungsFuchs — HTTP-Header (Cloudflare Pages)

# CDN-Cache, gesetzt 26.08.2026: Sevallas Standard war s-maxage=2592000 = 30 Tage
# auch fuer HTML. Ein Deploy blieb dadurch bis zu einen Monat unsichtbar - an
# VersicherungsFuchs nachgewiesen. 5 Minuten reichen, stale-while-revalidate
# haelt die Auslieferung trotzdem schnell.
/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, s-maxage=300, stale-while-revalidate=86400
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=63072000; includeSubDomains; preload
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=(), interest-cohort=()
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://www.googletagmanager.com https://www.googleadservices.com https://googleads.g.doubleclick.net https://js.stripe.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data: https://ad.doubleclick.net https://www.googletagmanager.com https://www.googleadservices.com https://googleads.g.doubleclick.net https://www.google.com https://www.google.de https://www.google-analytics.com https://*.google-analytics.com https://*.doubleclick.net https://*.googlesyndication.com; font-src 'self' data:; connect-src 'self' https://api.versicherungs-fuchs.online https://ad.doubleclick.net https://www.googletagmanager.com https://www.googleadservices.com https://googleads.g.doubleclick.net https://www.google.com https://www.google.de https://*.google-analytics.com https://*.analytics.google.com https://*.doubleclick.net https://*.googlesyndication.com https://api.stripe.com; frame-src https://td.doubleclick.net https://js.stripe.com https://hooks.stripe.com; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self' https://api.versicherungs-fuchs.online

/sitemap.xml
  Content-Type: application/xml; charset=utf-8
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex

/robots.txt
  Content-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8

/pkv-check/*
  ! Cache-Control
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate

# Statische Assets duerfen lang liegen bleiben - sie aendern sich selten.
# 11.10.2026 (Audit): Treffen mehrere Regeln, haengt der Host die Werte an (live war es
# "max-age=0, s-maxage=300, ..., public, max-age=31536000, immutable"). "! Cache-Control" loest den
# Wert der /*-Regel, danach gilt nur der eigene. Nach dem Deploy mit curl -I pruefen.
/assets/*
  ! Cache-Control
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
